ass=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_shafawi\">هِم مُّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نذِ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">رِي</span>نَ","قَالُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>قَوْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">نَآ</span> إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ا سَمِعْنَا كِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">تَٰ</span>بًا أُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نزِ</span>لَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">مِنۢ بَ</span>عْدِ مُوسَىٰ مُصَدِّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">قًا لِّ</span>مَا بَيْنَ يَدَيْهِ يَهْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">دِىٓ</span> إِلَى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ وَإِلَىٰ طَرِي<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">قٍ مُّ</span>سْتَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">قِي</span>مٍ","<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">يَٰ</span>قَوْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">نَآ</span> أَجِيبُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> دَاعِىَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَءَامِنُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> يَغْفِرْ لَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_shafawi\">كُم مِّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن ذُ</span>نُوبِكُمْ وَيُجِرْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_shafawi\">كُم مِّ</span>نْ عَذَابٍ أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">لِي</span>مٍ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">مَن لَّ</span>ا يُجِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span> دَاعِىَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ فَلَيْسَ بِمُعْجِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">زٍ فِ</span>ى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَلَيْسَ لَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikha